66	//	p4 0xd0f/0xd0v       absent under archA (25 <= 30), displacement
67	//	                      sev4 under candC (25 > 20): added;
68	//	p5 0xe0f/0xe0v/0xe0b sandwich sev4 under archA (15/11 bracket 10),
69	//	                      nothing under candC (sandwich off, 15 <= 20):
70	//	                      removed.
